    "summary_long": "Davis, a well-meaning screw-up, and Mark, a completely indifferent slacker, both reach rock bottom after getting fired from their jobs on the exact same day. Desperate for quick cash, they accept a job through a shady transport company to escort Sheridan, an arrogant and internet-famous rich teenager, across the country to a rehab facility. Sheridan immediately realizes his chaperones are completely out-of-the-depth, prompting him to run away, drug the duo, and pull every trick in the book to sabotage the journey. As they chase the elusive teen, Mark's Buick Century becomes a magnet for disaster, entangling the group with a succession of dangerous eccentrics. Along the way, they cross paths with a dream-chasing stripper, a lycanthrope-obsessed SoundCloud rapper, and a gun-toting juggalo warlord. As weapons, drugs, and local law enforcement enter the mix, the road trip descends into total, life-threatening mayhem. Sheridan's endless mischief forces Davis and Mark to confront their own personal failures while constantly fighting for survival. Despite the hopeless absurdity of their situation, the two incompetent leads form a genuine bond through their shared desperation. Against all odds, the unlikely trio barrels toward a chaotic climax that tests whether any of them can actually do something right for once.",
